WEBVTT

00:06.480 --> 00:11.000
Father! We searched everywhere—there's no sign of Chen Wan'er!

00:11.600 --> 00:19.500
Did she really think her petty schemes could achieve anything? Were it not for the memory of her father, I would be conducting her funeral right now!

00:20.080 --> 00:24.000
Cease your search—she cannot stir up any formidable waves.

00:26.320 --> 00:31.000
Go to the imperial prison at once and convey my instructions to the Prince of Ning.

00:30.240 --> 00:31.000
Understood!

00:34.000 --> 00:39.000
His Highness the Prince of Jin... this time, not even immortals can save you!
